          "dok": 2,
          "difficultyBand": 4,
          "prompt": "Solve ${{a}}x{{b|signed}}\\le {{c}}x{{d|signed}}$. After collecting variable terms, the coefficient of x is negative, so continue through the inequality reversal and write the final solution.",
